# KITT embeddings sidecars. Machine-specific dense vectors keyed by the
# local embedding model's version; regenerated on demand whenever the
# markdown corpus changes, so committing one only produces noisy diffs
# and merge conflicts. Same rule the `ensure_sidecar_gitignored` helper
# writes into managed projects, applied to this repo's own corpus.
LEARNINGS.embeddings.npz
*.embeddings.npz
